5,Chong language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/chong_language,"The Chong language (ISO 639-3: cog) is an endangered Austroasiatic language belonging to the Pearic branch of the Mon–Khmer family, primarily spoken by the Chong ethnic minority in southeastern Thai.",Chong,Austro-Asiatic
